; SquareWave_Matrix_Coalesced_255C_OrcaMotion_Check05_10
; Short verification job: original specimen IDs 05-10 only, same positions as full SVG
; squareWave0.6mm family, 0.3 / 0.4 / 0.5 mm vertical spacing, each at 0% and 50% upper PCF
; Two mirrored paths per pair; 10 layers, 0.06 mm each, 0.60 mm total; fixed line width 0.15 mm
; First layer 10 mm/s / fan off / acceleration 500; upper nine layers 15 mm/s / acceleration 2000
; Nozzle 255 C; bed 85 C; purge 20 mm/s; exact original 90-degree corners and extrusion totals
; 2 mm retraction-wipe along outro, lift before layer actions; no added fan-settling dwell
; Startup/calibration copied from full revised matrix; physical print verification required
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
